<title>JAPAN: Sankyo Engineering -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sankyo Engineering -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.33		vs	    4.43</p>
<p> Operating	   97    million	  vs	  112    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 35    million	  vs	 prft 70 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 53    million	  vs	 prft 60 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 7.92 yen	  vs     prft 8.93 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sankyo Engineering Co Ltd is a maker of injection molding machines and peripheral equipment.</p>
